#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: pod-ai-chat.php
msgid "Pod.AI Chat for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Pod.AI Chat for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
#: pod-ai-chat.php
msgid "https://podai.swisspro.site/"
msgstr "https://podai.swisspro.site/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pod-ai-chat.php
msgid "AI shopping assistant for WooCommerce: answers from your store's own data (products, policies, shipping), recommends in-stock products and adds them to the cart, looks up orders and tracking, and turns \"contact us\" into tickets."
msgstr "KI-Einkaufsassistent für WooCommerce: antwortet aus den eigenen Shopdaten (Produkte, Richtlinien, Versand), empfiehlt verfügbare Produkte und legt sie in den Warenkorb, findet Bestellungen und Sendungen und macht aus „Kontakt“ Tickets."

